{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116878","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116878/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116878/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116878/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116878","id":4004059731,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7uqRpT","number":116878,"title":"GDScript: _get_property_list() fails to update or behaves inconsistently compared to C#","user":{"login":"yellowbigdog","id":183289315,"node_id":"U_kgDOCuzF4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/183289315?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog","html_url":"https://github.com/yellowbigdog","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yellowbigdog/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":311852125,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTE4NTIxMjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20work","name":"needs work","color":"cc9999","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-02-28T06:45:09Z","updated_at":"2026-03-03T14:41:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot Engine v4.6.1.stable.mono.official (c) 2007-present Juan Linietsky, Ariel Manzur & Godot Contributors.\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-9300H CPU @ 2.40GHz (8 threads) - 15.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere is an inconsistency between GDScript and C# when overriding _get_property_list(). In GDScript, even after calling notify_property_list_changed(), the Inspector sometimes fails to reflect the updated property list or retains stale data. The same logic implemented in C# works perfectly, suggesting a potential issue in how GDScript handles dynamic property registration or notification compared to the .NET binding.\n\n\"Recompile C# and add node via button\"\n<img width=\"1329\" height=\"490\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d7f6ef4-962d-418a-95f3-b26c17e41263\" />\n\n<img width=\"608\" height=\"523\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/110bb4f4-dd47-409d-afd6-740286982a32\" />\n\n<img width=\"618\" height=\"479\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1a560dd-cce2-456f-8de3-a22ce43b2999\" />\n\n\"Save and reload\" \n\n<img width=\"601\" height=\"372\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6300a48-8883-45fb-a2d0-b0dd5cd056d9\" />\n\n<img width=\"605\" height=\"284\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5d60051-5974-417e-b08c-dff5c2d37e43\" />\n\n\"I replaced the standard @export list with a dynamic _get_property_list() implementation. After removing the @export keywords, the Inspector structure in GDScript becomes corrupted/broken, whereas it works fine in C#.\"\n\n<img width=\"579\" height=\"725\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0779b523-c45c-4610-9460-9644abaa7e04\" />\n\n<img width=\"688\" height=\"757\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0d58b9d5-a8ae-4570-b643-82bf8de17fd4\" />\n\n\"Identical input produces different results in C# and GDScript\"\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\"Scenario 1: Node adds correctly after C# recompile. Scenario 2: Same operation fails after saving and reloading GDScript.\"\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n<!-- Failed to upload \"bug.zip\" -->\n[gd_bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25622039/gd_bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116878/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}